{
  "about": "Formats and protocols that IRL streaming apps and services share, one entry per item. Each entry credits its maker; listing an item here does not mean this project makes, runs or endorses it. group: 'shared' when several makers' products write or read it; 'app-formats' for one app's own format that a named second product also writes or reads; 'steward-projects' for items made by people who steward this repository, kept apart so they are not mistaken for established standards. service_ids link products in services.json; other_users names products that are not catalogued. Descriptions are our own words; sources are public primary pages. checked_on is the day the entry was compared with its sources.",
  "standards": [
