          "label": "SRT access control (Stream ID)",
          "url": "https://github.com/Haivision/srt/blob/master/docs/features/access-control.md"
        },
        {
          "label": "irl-srt-server README",
          "url": "https://github.com/irlserver/irl-srt-server"
        },
        {
          "label": "OpenIRL srtla-receiver README",
          "url": "https://github.com/OpenIRL/srtla-receiver"
        }
      ],
      "notes": "The field is shared; the convention is not. Haivision recommends an optional '#!::' key=value syntax, while IRL receivers use their own keys (SRT Live Server style 'uplive.sls/live/<name>', OpenIRL 'live_<key>' and 'play_<key>')."
    },
